      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">A reliable vehicle leasing software for locating and recovering</span></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Car financing, car loans and car leasing is an attractive, yet very risky market. Car theft, late payments, defaults and expensive recovery procedures discourage car dealers and finance companies from growing or maintaining the status quo. So do the unreliable GPS tracking tools that just don’t help.</span></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This is where you change the landscape with LeaseControl, an auto leasing software. Introduce its telematics and IoT capabilities to protect financed vehicles, protect dealers’ profits and provide them with real business value.</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "A reliable vehicle leasing software for locating and recoveringCar financing, car loans and car leasing is an attractive, yet very risky market. Car theft, late payments, defaults and expensive recovery procedures discourage car dealers and finance companies from growing or maintaining the status quo. So do the unreliable GPS tracking tools that just don’t help.This is where you change the landscape with LeaseControl, an auto leasing software. Introduce its telematics and IoT capabilities to protect financed vehicles, protect dealers’ profits and provide them with real business value.",
