      "heading": "Market expansion venture into new niches",
      "bodyHtml": "<p><strong>Integration features</strong><br>Easily integrate with other systems using SDK</p><p><strong>For service providers:<br></strong>Proven technology<br>Based on reliable JaxiCloud platform.</p><p><strong>Experienced provider:<br></strong>Backed by two decades in telematics and IoT.</p><p><strong>Expert community<br></strong>Access to a large community of telematics and IoT experts.</p><p><strong>AGE OF FLEET TRACKING </strong><strong>ENJOY IT </strong><strong>USER-FRIENDLY</strong></p>",
      "bodyText": "Integration featuresEasily integrate with other systems using SDKFor service providers:Proven technologyBased on reliable JaxiCloud platform.Experienced provider:Backed by two decades in telematics and IoT.Expert communityAccess to a large community of telematics and IoT experts.AGE OF FLEET TRACKING ENJOY IT USER-FRIENDLY",
