      "heading": "Age of fleet tracking enjoy it",
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Market dynamics:<br></span></strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Growth in the auto lending market despite challenges.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong>JaxiCloud’s offering:</strong> <br>A GPS tracking solution designed for automatic financing.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Essentials:<br></span></strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Tools for tracking and restoring vehicle location.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Industry risks and solutions:<br></span></strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Addressing challenges faced by auto lenders with JaxiCloud.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong>Detecting risks:<br></strong> Using geofences and notifications to anticipate potential problems.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Quick answers:<br></span></strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Remote engine stop setting. Data insights: Access detailed vehicle activity data and tracks.</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "Market dynamics:Growth in the auto lending market despite challenges.JaxiCloud’s offering: A GPS tracking solution designed for automatic financing.Essentials:Tools for tracking and restoring vehicle location.Industry risks and solutions:Addressing challenges faced by auto lenders with JaxiCloud.Detecting risks: Using geofences and notifications to anticipate potential problems.Quick answers:Remote engine stop setting. Data insights: Access detailed vehicle activity data and tracks.",
