      "heading": "User-friendly",
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong>Remote control:</strong><br></span>Remotely start or stop a vehicle’s engine based on payment status.</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Custom Geofences:<br></span></strong>Configure geographic boundaries and get alerts about violations.</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Connection monitoring:<br></span></strong>Receive alerts about loss of connection.</p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong>Notification flexibility:<br></strong> Choose notification methods.</p>",
