      "heading": "Securing highrisk contracts",
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\">A reliable vehicle leasing software for location and recovery|</p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">In a world where vehicle leasing and car financing have become both a blessing and a challenge, JaxiCloud stands as a beacon of security and reliability. This cutting-edge fleet tracking solution is tailor-made for leasing and car financing companies, ensuring that assets are always within reach. With advanced telematics, IoT capabilities, and real-time tracking capabilities, JaxiCloud not only protects financed vehicles, but also empowers dealers to mitigate risk, increase profits, and deliver unmatched value. Step into the future of vehicle leasing management with JaxiCloud.</span></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong>Challenges:</strong> Stolen vehicles and late payments in the used and subprime auto loan market.</span></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong>Solution:</strong> Jaxicloud’s tools to track, locate and remotely control vehicles.</span></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Result: </span></strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Reduced risks and minimized costs associated with vehicle recovery.</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "A reliable vehicle leasing software for location and recovery|In a world where vehicle leasing and car financing have become both a blessing and a challenge, JaxiCloud stands as a beacon of security and reliability. This cutting-edge fleet tracking solution is tailor-made for leasing and car financing companies, ensuring that assets are always within reach. With advanced telematics, IoT capabilities, and real-time tracking capabilities, JaxiCloud not only protects financed vehicles, but also empowers dealers to mitigate risk, increase profits, and deliver unmatched value. Step into the future of vehicle leasing management with JaxiCloud.Challenges: Stolen vehicles and late payments in the used and subprime auto loan market.Solution: Jaxicloud’s tools to track, locate and remotely control vehicles.Result: Reduced risks and minimized costs associated with vehicle recovery.",
